Subject: [PATCH] Declared block entity renderers (API block 11)

data/<id>/horizon/renderer/<block>.json: cubes, a fluid box that rises with a
tank, spinning parts; sprites and tints per substance; tanks and energy are
sent to clients (with capacities) when a drawing changes by a sixteenth; pure
maths in horizon_mods::block_render (tested).
